            {"category": "Technical", "difficulty": "medium", "question_type": "scenario_based", "question_text": "How do you diagnose and resolve a database deadlock occurring in a concurrent transaction scenario?", "sample_answer": "Examine DB deadlock graphs to identify competing locks. Resolve by enforcing a uniform lock acquisition ordering across all transactions, reducing transaction scope, adding proper indexes, or using optimistic concurrency control."},
            {"category": "Project", "difficulty": "medium", "question_type": "project_experience", "question_text": "What automated testing frameworks (JUnit, Mockito, Jest) did you implement in your previous project, and how did you mock external services?", "sample_answer": "Explain using Mockito/Jest to mock repository layers and external HTTP clients, asserting that methods were called with expected arguments while writing isolated unit and slice tests."},
