            {"category": "Technical", "difficulty": "medium", "question_type": "scenario_based", "question_text": "A client complains that customer search queries are running extremely slowly on an Oracle/PostgreSQL table with 20M records. Walk through your optimization strategy.", "sample_answer": "Run EXPLAIN ANALYZE to identify sequential table scans. Add composite indexes matching query filter predicates. Rebuild bloated index trees and consider partial indexes or full-text search indexes."},
